{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "764b8810-a1eb-8642-bdf8-0ae609d8ef5c",
  "created_at": "2026-01-08T11:56:09-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Frank Grasso",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:54:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:54:18-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. Frank Grasso. I got a pothole to report. You got me on speaker, I got both hands full here, so tell me if I'm breaking up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:54:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're coming through okay, Frank. Where's the pothole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:54:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's at the intersection by my place. 167 Bridge Street, down the Point. Right at the corner there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:54:37-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 167 Bridge Street. How big are we talking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:54:41-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "About two feet across. Maybe a little more on the one side. Deep enough that cars drop into it and you hear it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:54:49-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'll rattle your teeth. Is this a new one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:54:53-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's the thing. They've patched it three times now. Fill it, it holds a couple weeks, then it opens right back up. That's the way it goes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:55:02-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three times, okay. I'll note that it's a repeat so it doesn't get logged like a fresh one. Let me put that in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:55:10-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Take your time. [pause] Sorry, I'm wearing two sweaters and fuzzy socks and I still can't get warm in this kitchen, so I'm just standing here by the radiator."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:55:20-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's been a cold week, no question. Okay, I've got the corner of Bridge Street, about two feet wide, patched three times. Anything else about it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:55:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. How long do repairs usually take, once it's reported?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:55:34-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For a pothole, usually a few days up to a week or so. In winter it can stretch, because the cold patch doesn't hold well and the crews get stacked up. A repeat one like yours I'll flag so someone looks at why it keeps going."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:55:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good enough. That's all I'm asking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:55:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you want a call back if there's an update? I have a number if you want me to use it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:55:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, use the one you got. 401-555-0158."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:56:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0158. You're all set, Frank."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:56:05-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thanks. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:56:07-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Stay warm."
    }
  ],
